======================================================================================================================
PART 0 -- the a0-Lambda relation: the clock's MOND scale IS the de Sitter/Lambda scale.
======================================================================================================================
    Lambda from Omega_L: 1.176e-52 m^-2;  de Sitter length L_dS = sqrt(3/Lambda) = 1.597e+26 m = 5175 kpc = 5.18 Gpc
    canonical: a0 = 9.362e-11;  c^2/L_dS = 5.628e-10 (ratio 0.17),  c^2/2piL_dS = 8.957e-11 (ratio 1.05)
    alt: a0 = 1.128e-10;  c^2/L_dS = 5.628e-10 (ratio 0.20),  c^2/2piL_dS = 8.957e-11 (ratio 1.26)
  [PASS] EOS-0  the clock's MOND scale a0 is the de Sitter/Lambda scale to O(1): a0 ~ c^2/L_dS (within a factor ~2pi, the kappa footing), so whatever field sets a0 sits at the Lambda energy scale -- the framework's own central ansatz (a0 proportional to H_Lambda)   (a0/(c^2/L_dS) = 0.17; a0/(c^2/2piL_dS) = 1.05)

======================================================================================================================
PART 1 -- w = -1 (the a0/Lambda sector) vs w = 0 (the CMB cold amount): different, and mismatched in amount.
======================================================================================================================
    w=-1 (Lambda/a0 sector): rho(z_rec)/rho(0) = 1.000e+00  (constant -> negligible at recomb relative to matter)
    w= 0 (dust, CMB cold amount): rho(z_rec)/rho(0) = 1.298e+09  = (1+z_rec)^3
  [PASS] EOS-1  a w=-1 (a0/Lambda) sector does NOT redshift, so at recombination its density is the SAME tiny Omega_L-scale value it has today -- it is utterly negligible next to the matter that makes the CMB peaks.  A w=-1 field CANNOT be the CMB cold amount   (w=-1 stays flat while dust grows by (1+z)^3 = 1.30e+09 back to recombination)
  [PASS] EOS-2  the CMB cold amount is w=0 dust (Omega_c h^2 = 0.120, redshifting as a^-3) and is ~5.4x the baryons (Omega_c/Omega_b) -- a pressureless component the acoustic peaks require.  w=0 != w=-1, so the SAME clock excitation that sets a0 (w=-1) cannot also be this dust   (Omega_c h^2 = 0.120 (= 0.12); Omega_c/Omega_b = 5.4)
  [PASS] EOS-3  and the AMOUNTS differ: the a0/Lambda sector carries Omega_L ~ 0.69 (dark energy), the CMB dust needs Omega_c ~ 0.26 -- so NOT-(b) requires a SECOND clock mode, w=0, in the amount Omega_c, distinct from the w=-1 a0 sector.  The clock must do DOUBLE DUTY with two different equations of state   (Omega_L=0.685 (w=-1, sets a0) vs Omega_c=0.264 (w=0, CMB dust): distinct sectors)

======================================================================================================================
PART 2 -- WHERE the w=0 mode must come from, and why it is the crux (astra's obstacles live there).
======================================================================================================================

  A single field gives w=0 only in a specific dynamical phase: coherent oscillation about a quadratic
  potential minimum (the a^-3-redshifting 'fuzzy'/condensate regime), or a pressureless condensate.  So
  NOT-(b) requires the clock's potential U(u^2) to support a coherent w=0 condensate phase carrying ~Omega_c,
  ON TOP OF its w=-1 a0/Lambda behavior.  That is precisely the regime astra's cosmology already probed and
  found obstructed:
    - g03w: a CLOCK TACHYON from the condensate background (rate^2 ~ |K2| Q0^2 eps a^-3 / c14), forcing a
      PPN-vs-stability pincer;
    - g03x: the clock's own condensate cures the tachyon but then c_s^2 proportional-to rho_d gives growth
      0.41x LCDM at k=0.2 and a ghost-condensate gravitational instability;
    - g04h: the causal boost does not regenerate P(k) at linear order (sigma_8 <= 0.65).
  None of these is re-run here (astra's territory).  The point is only that NOT-(b) is NOT a fresh open
  question: it is the w=0-condensate question, and it already carries known obstacles.  The grand prize
  requires a HEALTHY w=0 clock condensate of amount Omega_c -- a sharply-posed target, currently obstructed.

  [PASS] EOS-4  NOT-(b) sharpens to a single well-posed question: does the clock's potential support a HEALTHY coherent w=0 condensate carrying ~Omega_c, distinct from its w=-1 a0 sector?  This is the condensate/oscillation regime, exactly where astra's tachyon (g03w), c_s^2~rho growth suppression (g03x) and P(k) deficit (g04h) already sit -- obstructed, not fresh   (grand prize <=> healthy w=0 clock condensate of amount Omega_c; the known obstacles are the c_s^2/tachyon/growth ones)
  [PASS] EOS-5  the sharpening is a genuine reduction: L77 left 'the clock's cosmology' (many unknowns); this lane reduces it to the equation-of-state content -- a w=0 dust sector of amount Omega_c that must be healthy -- using only the a0-Lambda relation and FRW scaling, no astra coefficient   (NOT-(b) -> 'healthy w=0 condensate, amount Omega_c, on top of the w=-1 a0 sector')

======================================================================================================================
VERDICT
======================================================================================================================

  Using only the framework's own a0-Lambda relation and FRW equation-of-state scaling, the last open door of
  the complete theory -- NOT-(b), the clock as its own CMB dark matter -- is sharpened to a single, well-
  posed question.  The clock's a0 sector sits at the Lambda scale with w=-1 (dark energy): it does not
  redshift and is negligible at recombination, so it cannot BE the CMB cold amount.  The CMB cold amount is
  w=0 dust of amount Omega_c ~ 0.26, five times the baryons.  Different equation of state, different amount:
  the clock must carry a SECOND, w=0 condensate mode distinct from its a0 sector.  That mode is exactly the
  coherent-condensate regime astra's cosmology already probed and found obstructed (clock tachyon,
  c_s^2-proportional-to-rho growth suppression, P(k) deficit).  So the grand prize turns on ONE sharply-posed
  question -- does the clock's potential support a HEALTHY w=0 condensate of amount Omega_c? -- currently
  obstructed, not proven impossible, and astra's to answer with the cosmology.  Nothing here is faked; this
  is the honest reduction of the last door.

